    "Observation: Model 6 Lasso Regression resulted in test MSE still lags behind Model 2 and 3. This is surprising as Lasso aggressively eliminates features (coefs to zero). Maybe this is because Polynomial degree was set to 3 (3 is from hyper-parameter tuning from Model 5)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Model 7\n",
    "Lasso as Feature Selector + Linear Regression\n",
    "- Rather than using the Lasso as the estimator, use the results of the Lasso to select features that are subsequently used in a Linear Regression estimator\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 57,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "DATA MODELING: MODEL 7\n",
      "Lasso as Feature Selector + Linear Regression\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "Train MSE:  42583258.44\n",
      "Test MSE:   42709748.22\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "# Model 7 #\n",
    "# Use SelectFromModel with Lasso Regression (L1 regularization) to select features in a pipeline,\n",
    "#  to later feed to a Linear Regression estimator\n",
    "# Transform numeric features to polynomials with degree = 3 (my best guess based on Model 5 best param)\n",
    "\n",
    "pipe7 = Pipeline([('poly_features', PolynomialFeatures(degree = 3, include_bias = False)),\n",
    "                  ('scaler', StandardScaler()),\n",
    "                  ('selector', SelectFromModel(Lasso())),\n",
    "                  ('linreg', LinearRegression())])\n",
    "\n",
    "pipe7.fit(X_train[num_feature_list], y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "train_preds7 = pipe7.predict(X_train[num_feature_list])\n",
    "test_preds7 = pipe7.predict(X_test[num_feature_list])\n",
    "model_7_train_mse = mean_squared_error(y_train, train_preds7)\n",
    "model_7_test_mse = mean_squared_error(y_test, test_preds7)\n",
    "\n",
    "model_mse_rows.append({\n",
    "    \"Model\": \"Lasso Selector + Lin Reg\",\n",
    "    \"Model Description\": \"Lasso as Feature Selector + Linear Regression\",\n",
    "    \"Train MSE\": model_7_train_mse,\n",
    "    \"Test MSE\": model_7_test_mse,\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=\"*100)\n",
    "print(\"DATA MODELING: MODEL 7\\nLasso as Feature Selector + Linear Regression\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*100)\n",
    "print(f'Train MSE: {model_7_train_mse: .2f}')\n",
    "print(f'Test MSE:  {model_7_test_mse: .2f}')\n",
    "print(\"=\"*100)\n"
   ]
  },
