       "            tol\n",
       "            <span class=\"param-doc-description\"\n",
       "            style=\"position-anchor: --doc-link-tol;\">\n",
       "            tol: float, default=None<br><br>If the score is not incremented by at least `tol` between two<br>consecutive feature additions or removals, stop adding or removing.<br><br>`tol` can be negative when removing features using `direction=&quot;backward&quot;`.<br>`tol` is required to be strictly positive when doing forward selection.<br>It can be useful to reduce the number of features at the cost of a small<br>decrease in the score.<br><br>`tol` is enabled only when `n_features_to_select` is `&quot;auto&quot;`.<br><br>.. versionadded:: 1.1</span>\n",
       "        </a>\n",
